{"level":4,"rules":[{"id":"AI-01","category":"FLOW","priority":112,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_COMPACT","stop_tag":"STOP_HIGH"},"advice":"短い範囲で停止地点が多いため、すべてのPOIで止まらず、主要な停止地点を絞る運用を検討しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","cluster_length_m","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["REDUCE_STOPS","KEEP_FLOWING"]},{"id":"AI-02","category":"FLOW","priority":110,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_MID","stop_tag":"STOP_LOW"},"advice":"POI群はまとまっていますが停止地点は少ないため、エリア全体を一つの回遊区間として活用できます。","facts_used":["group_size","cluster_length_m","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["TREAT_AS_ROUTE_SECTION","USE_CIRCULATION"]},{"id":"AI-03","category":"FLOW","priority":106,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_SPREAD","stop_tag":"STOP_LOW"},"advice":"停止地点を限定しつつ広い範囲へ参加者を流す運用が組み立てやすい構成です。","facts_used":["group_size","cluster_length_m","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["DISTRIBUTE_FLOW","REDUCE_STOPS"]},{"id":"AI-04","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":116,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","traffic":"narrow","stop_tag":"STOP_HIGH"},"advice":"人数が多く停止も多い場合は、狭い区間で停止せず、説明地点を幅のある場所へまとめましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","traffic","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["NO_STOP_IN_NARROW_AREA","REDUCE_STOPS","MOVE_TO_WIDER_AREA"]},{"id":"AI-05","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":118,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","traffic":"careful","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_COMPACT"},"advice":"人数がまとまりやすい条件です。通行エリアでは停止を減らし、参加者を速やかに次の場所へ案内しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","traffic","cluster_length_m"],"behavior_tags":["PRIORITIZE_PUBLIC_FLOW","REDUCE_STOPS","KEEP_FLOWING"]},{"id":"AI-06","category":"GATHERING","priority":114,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","plaza":false,"waiting":false},"advice":"全員集合を前提にせず、ローリングスタートや複数の開始タイミングを検討しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","plaza","waiting"],"behavior_tags":["DISTRIBUTED_START","ROLLING_START"]},{"id":"AI-07","category":"FLOW","priority":115,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","circulation":true,"stop_tag":"STOP_HIGH"},"advice":"回遊できる環境を活かし、停止地点を選別して参加者をルート上へ流し続ける運用が向いています。","facts_used":["group_size","circulation","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["USE_CIRCULATION","REDUCE_STOPS","KEEP_FLOWING"]},{"id":"AI-08","category":"WAITING","priority":113,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","waiting":false,"cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_COMPACT"},"advice":"密集エリア内に待機を作らず、到着した参加者から順次プレイを開始できる形にしましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","waiting","cluster_length_m"],"behavior_tags":["NO_WAITING","MOVE_AFTER_ARRIVAL","ROLLING_START"]},{"id":"AI-09","category":"GATHERING","priority":108,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","plaza":true,"density_tag":"VERY_CLOSE_HEAVY"},"advice":"近接POIそのものを集合地点にせず、広場で説明してから密集エリアへ送り出しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","plaza","under20_ratio"],"behavior_tags":["PLAZA_AS_HUB","SEPARATE_GATHERING_FROM_POI"]},{"id":"AI-10","category":"WAITING","priority":105,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","waiting":true,"density_tag":"VERY_CLOSE_HEAVY"},"advice":"待機場所をハブとして使い、近接POI周辺で参加者を待たせない運用ができます。","facts_used":["group_size","waiting","under20_ratio"],"behavior_tags":["WAITING_AS_HUB","NO_WAIT_AT_DENSE_POI"]},{"id":"AI-11","category":"FLOW","priority":102,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_MID","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_COMPACT","stop_tag":"STOP_HIGH"},"advice":"中規模グループでも短い範囲で停止が続くため、停止地点をまとめると流れを作りやすくなります。","facts_used":["group_size","cluster_length_m","expected_stop_points"],"behavior_tags":["REDUCE_STOPS","KEEP_FLOWING"]},{"id":"AI-12","category":"ROUTE","priority":98,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_MID","cluster_tag":"CLUSTER_MID","stop_tag":"STOP_LOW","circulation":true},"advice":"停止地点が少ないので、POI群を一つのルートとして巡る運用に向いています。","facts_used":["group_size","cluster_length_m","expected_stop_points","circulation"],"behavior_tags":["TREAT_AS_ROUTE_SECTION","USE_CIRCULATION"]},{"id":"AI-13","category":"ROUTE","priority":94,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_SMALL","density_tag":"VERY_CLOSE_HEAVY","circulation":true},"advice":"少人数なら近接POIを活用しやすいため、短い回遊ルートとしてまとめる方法があります。","facts_used":["group_size","under20_ratio","circulation"],"behavior_tags":["USE_CIRCULATION","SHORT_LOOP"]},{"id":"AI-14","category":"FLOW","priority":109,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","circulation":false,"waiting":false},"advice":"一斉に同じ経路へ送り出さず、グループを分けるか開始時間をずらして流れを分散しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","circulation","waiting"],"behavior_tags":["DISTRIBUTE_FLOW","STAGGER_START"]},{"id":"AI-15","category":"TRAFFIC","priority":119,"when":{"group_tag":"GROUP_LARGE","stop_tag":"STOP_HIGH","traffic":"narrow","waiting":false},"advice":"狭い場所での停止と待機をなくし、止まる場所を少数の広い地点へ集約する運用を検討しましょう。","facts_used":["group_size","expected_stop_points","traffic","waiting"],"behavior_tags":["NO_STOP_IN_NARROW_AREA","NO_WAITING","REDUCE_STOPS","MOVE_TO_WIDER_AREA"]}]}